<title>MEXICO: Mexican gulf ports reopen after cold front.</title>
<headline>Mexican gulf ports reopen after cold front.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican ports along the Gulf of Mexico coast were reopened on Wednesday after a cold front left the area, the Communications and Transport Ministry said.</p>
<p>The ministry said in a statement that a few ports were still closed to small vessels along the coast, but that larger ships were being allowed to set sail.</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9565</p>
</text>
